--Install dependencies--
Type in terminal:
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Download NLTK resources
Type in Command Prompt:
python
import nltk
nltk.download('punkt')
nltk.download('wordnet')
nltk.download('omw-1.4')

--Run Streamlit Web App--
Type in terminal:
streamlit run app.py
1. Choose a model (Logistic Regression, SVM, BERT) from the sidebar
2. Use the tabs to:
   Single Review: Input or select a review and generate a prediction + reply
   Batch Prediction: Upload a CSV with a text column and download results
3. Compare Model Performance:
   Open the "Model Comparison" page in Streamlit from the sidebar
   Click "Run Model Evaluation" to compare Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1 Score

--Run via Console--
Type in terminal:
python main.py
1. Choose a model (1=Logistic Regression, 2=SVM, 3=BERT)
2. Enter reviews manually and receive predictions
3. Type exit to quit